# Knowledge Markdown

`knowledge/projects/*.md` is indexed. Skip `_template_project.md`. `knowledge/skills/` is not indexed.

Follow `_template_project.md` frontmatter: `title`, `organization`, `role`, `environment`, `period`, `status`, `technologies`, `concepts`, `dependencies`, `links`.

```text
# BAD ? technologies lists tools only mentioned as alternatives
# GOOD ? technologies = implemented stack
```

- Split on Markdown headings. Nested headings become `HeadingPath`. Headings are stripped from chunk content.
- Typical sections: Overview, Context, Task, Challenge, Result, Technical Decisions, Implementation, Lessons Learned, Future Improvements.
- After changing project docs, run `dotnet run --project src/tools/KnowledgeIndexer` from the repo root.
- Indexer upserts by chunk id; deleted/renamed files need a table wipe then re-index.
- If the product story of this repo changes, update `knowledge/projects/ai-candidate-assistant-rag.md` and `AGENTS.md`.
